    {
      "text": "From the state Housing Element Annual Progress Report, through 2025.",
      "src": [
        "SRC-001142"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "LAFCo staff report (Jan 2024): 5-story building, 103 rental units (16 low-income) and 69 garage spaces on a 0.71-acre lot merged from APNs 046-032-030, -040, -080 and -090; 111,654 sq ft gross floor area; 145 units per acre; 56 ft 6 in to roofline. Site was in unincorporated San Mateo County; annexation to Belmont by landowner petition.",
      "src": [
        "SRC-003019"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Annexation petition: studios, 1-bedroom and 2-bedroom units from 404 to 1,357 sq ft. Fiscal analysis in the packet names the project the 608 Harbor Multi-Family Apartment Development, or Windy Hill 2. Site was a Flyers gas station and car wash.",
      "src": [
        "SRC-003019"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Belmont staff report (May 2021): 103 apartments, 15% affordable, applicant Windy Hill Corporation, annexation from the Harbor Industrial Area, City Council review anticipated.",
